{"id":"1530bb34c38bf5bb","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"Interpretation of terms (legacy)","display":"df-term-interpretation — Interpretation of terms (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["27-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — Interpretation of terms (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-structure]]","[[27-df-assignment]]","[[27-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — Interpretation of terms (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 及符号解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" href=\"?note=9ab26a4ec0de4af8\" title=\"27-df-assignment\">27-df-assignment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ct}\">\\(\\mathrm{ct}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a>。常量、函数符号及项列仅在各自递归分支的局部域取值，签名不必含常量或函数符号。</li>\n<li>引入项解释映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\mapsto t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\">\\(t\\mapsto t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\)</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\qquad\\mathrm{ct}(c)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq c^{\\mathfrak A}\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\qquad\\mathrm{ct}(c)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq c^{\\mathfrak A}\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq f^{\\mathfrak A}(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_m^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq f^{\\mathfrak A}(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_m^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>补足变量、常量和函数符号的类型；区别常量符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的结构解释与常量项叶子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ct}(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{ct}(c)\\)</span> 的项解释。结构的非空载体与全函数解释保证每步返回唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 元素。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 及符号解释见 [[27-df-structure]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[27-df-assignment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9ab26a4ec0de4af8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 及符号解释见 [[27-df-structure]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[27-df-assignment]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\mathrm{ct}$ 见 [[27-df-atomic-formula]]。常量、函数符号及项列仅在各自递归分支的局部域取值，签名不必含常量或函数符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ct}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\mapsto t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\qquad\\mathrm{ct}(c)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq c^{\\mathfrak A}\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)).","display":true},{"tex":"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_m)^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\coloneqq f^{\\mathfrak A}(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_m^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ct}(c)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；项解释见 [[27-df-term-interpretation]]，语法见 [[27-df-formula]]。关系符号及其项列在关系原子分支中局部限定；允许无关系符号的签名。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-term-interpretation|df-term-interpretation — Interpretation of terms (legacy)]]"}],"outgoing":["ea25e09b331cbbdb","9ab26a4ec0de4af8","23484c14c788f5da"]}